  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tsp coconut oil in a ramekin over medium heat until hot.",
    "Add diced onion and minced garlic, sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in diced tofu and cook for 2 minutes until lightly browned.",
    "Add sliced asparagus, 2 tbsp soy sauce, 1 tbsp fish sauce, 200 ml water, and 1 tsp salt, bring to a simmer.",
    "Pour in 400 ml coconut milk and 2 tbsp peanut butter, stir until the sauce thickens and coats the vegetables.",
    "Add 30 g white sugar candy, stir until melted and the sauce is slightly sweet.",
    "Reduce heat, let the stew simmer for 10 minutes until the asparagus is tender.",
    "Sprinkle 100 g shredded cheddar cheese over the top, cover the ramekin, and let the cheese pull for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve hot straight from the ramekin, optionally garnished with extra cheese or a pinch of pepper."
  ],
